### 🔧 **Dependencies**
- Bullet Physics (install via package manager or download from [https://github.com/bulletphysics/bullet3](https://github.com/bulletphysics/bullet3))
- C++17 or newer
- A rendering library (e.g., OpenGL, DirectX, or a simple console output for this example)

